@startuml
title CTS Trading and Support Activity

start

:Receive instructions from trade client serve;
:Analyze incoming instructions;
:Divide instructions into kinds;
:Match instructions under prescripts;
:Provide interfaces and send messages to other modules;
if (Select instruction type) then (buy instruction received)
:Give buy instruction;
:Save buy instruction;
:Match buy instructions with same stock id;
if (Buy match result) then (matched stock exists and no exception and operations not suspended)
:Make buy trade by matching;
:Modify matched buy instruction information;
:Give out successful trade information;
:Save trade information;
if (Trade information save result) then (operations suspended)
:Handle save-trade operations suspended;
else (no matched stock exists)
:Handle no matched stock for save-trade flow;
endif
elseif (Buy match result) then (operations suspended)
:Handle buy operations suspended;
elseif (Buy match result) then (trade exception occurs)
:Handle buy trade exceptions;
else (no matched stock exists)
:Report no matched stock for buy instruction;
endif
stop
elseif (Select instruction type) then (sell instruction received)
:Give sell instruction;
:Save sell instruction;
:Match sell instructions with same stock id;
if (Sell match result) then (matched stock exists and no exception and operations not suspended)
:Make sell trade by matching;
:Modify matched sell instruction information;
:Give out successful trade information;
:Save trade information;
if (Trade information save result) then (operations suspended)
:Handle save-trade operations suspended;
else (no matched stock exists)
:Handle no matched stock for save-trade flow;
endif
elseif (Sell match result) then (operations suspended)
:Handle sell operations suspended;
elseif (Sell match result) then (deal exception occurs)
:Handle sell deal exceptions;
else (no matched stock exists)
:Report no matched stock for sell instruction;
endif
elseif (Select instruction type) then (cancel instruction received)
:Give cancel instruction;
:Save cancel instruction;
:Cancel correlative instruction;
if (Cancel result) then (operations suspended)
:Handle cancel operations suspended;
elseif (Cancel result) then (instruction already implemented)
:Handle already implemented instruction;
else (no matched instruction exists)
:Handle no matched instruction to cancel;
endif
else (query received)
:Send query;
:Implement query;
:Structuralize queried data;
:Send data to release;
if (Query result) then (operations suspended)
:Handle query operations suspended;
elseif (Query result) then (query is invalid)
:Handle invalid query;
else (no matched data)
:Handle no matched data;
:System manager accesses CTS information under authorization;
:Maintain CTS for crash recovery and new requirements;
:Consider frequent operations, heavy transfer, and overload capacity;
endif
endif
stop

@enduml